From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Suzuki K Poulose <suzuki.poulose@arm.com>
Date: Wed, 20 Aug 2025 15:55:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] NVIDIA: VR: SAUCE: kvm: arm64: Include kvm_emulate.h in
 kvm/arm_psci.h
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

BugLink: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2139249

Fix a potential build error (like below, when asm/kvm_emulate.h gets
included after the kvm/arm_psci.h) by including the missing header file
in kvm/arm_psci.h:

./include/kvm/arm_psci.h: In function ‘kvm_psci_version’:
./include/kvm/arm_psci.h:29:13: error: implicit declaration of function
   ‘vcpu_has_feature’; did you mean ‘cpu_have_feature’? [-Werror=implicit-function-declaration]
   29 |         if (vcpu_has_feature(vcpu, KVM_ARM_VCPU_PSCI_0_2)) {
	         |             ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
			       |             cpu_have_feature

Reviewed-by: Gavin Shan <gshan@redhat.com>
Signed-off-by: Suzuki K Poulose <suzuki.poulose@arm.com>
Signed-off-by: Steven Price <steven.price@arm.com>
(cherry picked from https://lore.kernel.org/20250820145606.180644-2-steven.price@arm.com/)
Signed-off-by: Ian May <ianm@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Jamie Nguyen <jamien@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Matthew R. Ochs <mochs@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Jacob Martin <jacob.martin@canonical.com>
Acked-by: Abdur Rahman <abdur.rahman@canonical.com>
Signed-off-by: Ian May <ianm@nvidia.com>
Ledger-Change: C-00427
Ledger-Origin: nvidia-6.17@6d5d1e2a33a87d54b8e13bba277f00a6c51949ba
---
 include/kvm/arm_psci.h | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/include/kvm/arm_psci.h b/include/kvm/arm_psci.h
index cbaec804eb83..38dab7add79b 100644
--- a/include/kvm/arm_psci.h
+++ b/include/kvm/arm_psci.h
@@ -10,6 +10,8 @@
 #include <linux/kvm_host.h>
 #include <uapi/linux/psci.h>
 
+#include <asm/kvm_emulate.h>
+
 #define KVM_ARM_PSCI_0_1	PSCI_VERSION(0, 1)
 #define KVM_ARM_PSCI_0_2	PSCI_VERSION(0, 2)
 #define KVM_ARM_PSCI_1_0	PSCI_VERSION(1, 0)
